ng</li>\n      <li><b>●</b> needs you</li>\n      <li><b>●</b> unread</li>\n      <li><span>○</span> clear</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p><kbd id=\"f1\">F1</kbd> to catch up.</p>\n    \n    <ul aria-label=\"Works with\">\n      <li><a href=\"https://claude.com/claude-code\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\">Claude Code</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/codex/\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\">Codex</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://pi.dev\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\">Pi</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://opencode.ai\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\">OpenCode</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2><span>new <s>tab</s> agent</span></h2>\n    <p><kbd id=\"ctrl-t\">Ctrl-T</kbd> to jump into work, new or old.</p>\n    <p>Use your existing accounts. All of them.</p>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"overview\">\n    <h2><span><code>top</code> for your tokens</span></h2>\n    <p>Where did the tokens go?</p>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  <section data-feature=\"steps\">\n    <h2><span>activity tracking</span></h2>\n    <p>Hover an agent to see what it did.</p>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"keep-running\">\n    <h2><span>Keep ’em running</span></h2>\n    <p>Like tmux, your agents and processes keep running in the background.</p>\n    <p><code>corgi</code> and you’re in.</p>\n    <div id=\"running-desktop\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two terminals on one Corgi. One closes and reopens while the agent and dev server keep running.\">\n      <div>\n        <div id=\"running-window-agent\">\n          <p><span>terminal 1 · agent</span></p>\n          \n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p><span>terminal 2 · dev server</span></p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p><span>●</span> <span id=\"running-status\">agents + dev server · running in the background</span></p>\n    </div>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  <section data-feature=\"reviews\">\n    <h2><sp