>\n    <p>Fantastic trees and where to find them.</p>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>clever corgi</h2>\n    <p>Organizes your workspaces for you.</p>\n    \n    \n  </section>\n\n  <section data-feature=\"resources\">\n    <h2>resource usage</h2>\n    <p>Per workspace, live.</p>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>embraces the modern terminal</h2>\n    <p>⌘V just pastes an image, even on SSH*.</p>\n    <p>Links you can copy.</p>\n    \n    <p>Images you can see.</p>\n    \n    <p>* Requires Ghostty Nightly.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"tricks\">\n    <h2>Tab Tricks</h2>\n    <p>Undo tab closes with Ctrl-Shift-T.</p>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  \n\n  <section id=\"cli\">\n    <h2>hackable</h2>\n    <p>Drive Corgi from any terminal. corgi --skill teaches your agents.</p>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>keyboard and mouse</h2>\n    <p>Corgi loves both.</p>\n    \n    \n  </section>\n\n  \n</div></div>"}